{
  "name": "dsh-pet-lingchong",
  "version": "1.1.3",
  "description": "灵宠 · DSH 桌宠：布偶猫 / 金毛 / 水豚三只常驻，可拖动、轻叩蓄能、眨眼表情、打盹、合成音效与粒子；不止宠物——照片（宠物 / 人像 / 动漫）变 2.5D 立绘，GLB / VRM（人物、动漫角色、自己的建模）变真 3D 转台，大小 30%–300% 无级调节。A floating desktop companion for DSH that accepts photos, GLB and VRM models.",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./lib/index.js",
  "icon": "assets/icon.png",
  "license": "BSD-3-Clause",
  "author": "nszm",
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "css",
    "assets",
    "scripts",
    "README.md",
    "src",
    "cordis.patch.yml"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "pet",
    "desktop-pet",
    "lingchong",
    "widget"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "react": "^18.2.0 || ^19.0.0"
  },
  "peerDependenciesMeta": {
    "react": {
      "optional": true
    }
  },
  "scripts": {
    "build": "node scripts/build.mjs",
    "verify": "node scripts/verify-bundle.mjs",
    "sync": "node scripts/sync-css.mjs",
    "check": "node ../dev/node_modules/typescript/bin/tsc -p tsconfig.json && node scripts/verify-bundle.mjs"
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-session"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    },
    "engines": {
      "dsh": ">=0.1.5-rc.1"
    }
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/nszm/dsh-pet-lingchong.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/nszm/dsh-pet-lingchong#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/nszm/dsh-pet-lingchong/issues"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "three": "^0.169.0"
  }
}
